### Active stop factors
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/stop-factors

### Conditions of a stop factor
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/stop-factors/13/conditions

### Clean client -> APPROVED (200)
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/stop-factors/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scoringId": 1,
  "creditHistoryStatuses": ["Open", "FullyPaid"],
  "values": {
    "numberOfActiveDisputes": 0, "numberOfUnjustifiedDisputesInPast": 0,
    "numberOfRestructuringsLast12Months": 0, "countOfChangesObLast12Month": 0,
    "numberOfRestructuringsFrom12To24Months": 0, "countOfChangesObFrom13To24Months": 0,
    "creditInquiriesLast7Days": 3, "currentNumberOfDaysOverdue": 0, "currentAmountOfOverdue": 0,
    "totalNumberOfNewOpenLoansInTheLast30Days": 1, "totalOpenCreditContracts": 2,
    "overdue": {}
  }
}

### Restructuring in 13-24 months + KIB transfer status -> UNDERWRITER (301)
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/stop-factors/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scoringId": 2,
  "creditHistoryStatuses": ["TransferredToOtherReportingInst"],
  "values": { "numberOfRestructuringsFrom12To24Months": 1, "overdue": { "countWherePeriodFrom1To3MonthsAndOverdueFrom1To15": 7 } }
}

### Current overdue -> REJECTED (451)
POST http://localhost:9090/api/v1/stop-factors/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scoringId": 3,
  "values": { "currentNumberOfDaysOverdue": 5, "currentAmountOfOverdue": 1200.50 }
}

### Saved results of a scoring
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/stop-factors/checks/3
